---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import edgeTemplates from '../assets/gen/edge-templates.jpg';
import edgeLine from '../assets/gen/edge-line.jpg';
import edgeFast from '../assets/gen/edge-fast.jpg';
---

<section class="section edge" id="edge" aria-labelledby="edge-heading">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="edge-head">
      <p class="eyebrow" data-reveal>Why DevCraft</p>
      <h2 class="h-display h2" id="edge-heading" data-split-lines>
        The unfair <em class="serif-i text-acid">advantage.</em>
      </h2>
    </div>

    <div class="bento">
      <article class="cell cell-big" data-reveal>
        <div class="cell-media" aria-hidden="true">
          <video data-ambient-video muted loop playsinline preload="none" width="1280" height="507">
            <source src="/media/edge-veins-loop.webm" type="video/webm" />
            <source src="/media/edge-veins-loop.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
          </video>
          <div class="cell-media-scrim"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="perf-hud" aria-hidden="true" data-perf-hud>
          <div class="hud-gauge">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 120 120" fill="none">
              <circle class="gauge-track" cx="60" cy="60" r="52"></circle>
              <circle class="gauge-fill" data-gauge-ring cx="60" cy="60" r="52"></circle>
            </svg>
            <div class="gauge-num"><span data-gauge-num>98</span></div>
          </div>
          <div class="hud-side">
            <span class="hud-title">Lighthouse — performance</span>
            <ul class="hud-metrics">
              <li>
                <span class="m-name">LCP</span>
                <span class="m-bar"><i data-bar style="--v: 0.92"></i></span>
                <span class="m-val">0.6s</span>
              </li>
              <li>
                <span class="m-name">CLS</span>
                <span class="m-bar"><i data-bar style="--v: 1"></i></span>
                <span class="m-val">0.00</span>
              </li>
              <li>
                <span class="m-name">INP</span>
                <span class="m-bar"><i data-bar style="--v: 0.96"></i></span>
                <span class="m-val">38ms</span>
              </li>
              <li>
                <span class="m-name">TTFB</span>
                <span class="m-bar"><i data-bar style="--v: 0.97"></i></span>
                <span class="m-val">90ms</span>
              </li>
            </ul>
            <span class="hud-note">median of last 12 builds — real audits, not vibes</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <h3>Performance is the product</h3>
        <p>
          Slow sites lose sales. Every build targets 95+ Lighthouse, sub-second loads and
          Core Web Vitals in the green — because speed is a feature your customers feel.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="cell cell-visual" data-reveal>
        <Image
          class="cell-bg"
          src={edgeTemplates}
          alt=""
          width={640}
          densities={[1, 2]}
          quality={70}
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <div class="cell-media-scrim" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <span class="cell-stat">0</span>
        <h3>Templates used</h3>
        <p>Everything is designed and coded for your brand. You own the stack — no lock-in.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="cell cell-visual" data-reveal>
        <Image
          class="cell-bg"
          src={edgeLine}
          alt=""
          width={640}
          densities={[1, 2]}
          quality={70}
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <div class="cell-media-scrim" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <span class="cell-stat">1:1</span>
        <h3>Direct line to the builders</h3>
        <p>No account managers, no telephone game. You talk to the people doing the work.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="cell cell-visual" data-reveal>
        <Image
          class="cell-bg"
          src={edgeFast}
          alt=""
          width={640}
          densities={[1, 2]}
          quality={70}
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <div class="cell-media-scrim" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <span class="cell-stat">48h</span>
        <h3>First concept, fast</h3>
        <p>A visual direction on your screen within two days of kickoff. Momentum from day one.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="cell cell-acid" data-reveal>
        <h3>Design that converts</h3>
        <p>
          Award-level craft in service of one metric: revenue. Motion, story and psychology —
          all aimed at the buy button.
        </p>
        <a href="#contact" class="cell-link" data-cursor="Go">Let's talk →</a>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .edge {
    background: var(--bg-soft);
    border-block: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .edge-head {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1.8rem;
    margin-bottom: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 5rem);
    max-width: 56rem;
  }

  .bento {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 1.2rem;
  }

  .cell {
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 1.4rem;
    padding: clamp(1.6rem, 3vw, 2.4rem);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.8rem;
    position: relative;
    overflow: clip;
    transition: border-color 0.5s var(--ease-expo), transform 0.5s var(--ease-expo);
  }

  .cell:hover {
    border-color: var(--ink-faint);
    transform: translateY(-4px);
  }

  .cell-media {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    z-index: 0;
  }

  .cell-media video {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    opacity: 0.5;
  }

  .cell-media-scrim {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    z-index: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(
      180deg,
      rgba(11, 11, 14, 0.72) 0%,
      rgba(11, 11, 14, 0.38) 45%,
      rgba(11, 11, 14, 0.86) 100%
    );
  }

  .cell h3,
  .cell p,
  .cell .cell-stat,
  .cell .cell-link {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .cell :global(.cell-bg) {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    z-index: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    opacity: 0.42;
    transform: scale(1.02);
    transition:
      opacity 0.6s var(--ease-expo),
      transform 0.9s var(--ease-expo);
  }

  .cell-visual:hover :global(.cell-bg) {
    opacity: 0.62;
    transform: scale(1.07);
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce), (max-width: 760px) {
    .cell-media video {
      display: none;
    }
  }

  .cell h3 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    line-height: 1.15;
  }

  .cell p {
    color: var(--ink-dim);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }

  .cell-stat {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: clamp(2.6rem, 2rem + 2.4vw, 4.4rem);
    line-height: 0.9;
    color: var(--acid);
  }

  .cell-big {
    grid-column: span 2;
    grid-row: span 2;
    justify-content: flex-end;
    min-height: 24rem;
  }

  .cell-big h3 {
    font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 1.2rem + 1.6vw, 2.4rem);
    max-width: 20ch;
  }

  .cell-big p {
    max-width: 40rem;
    font-size: 1.02rem;
  }

  .cell-big {
    background-image:
      linear-gradient(rgba(242, 239, 232, 0.035) 1px, transparent 1px),
      linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(242, 239, 232, 0.035) 1px, transparent 1px);
    background-size: 2.6rem 2.6rem;
    background-position: center;
  }

  .perf-hud {
    z-index: 1;
    position: absolute;
    top: clamp(1.6rem, 3vw, 2.4rem);
    left: clamp(1.6rem, 3vw, 2.4rem);
    right: clamp(1.6rem, 3vw, 2.4rem);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: clamp(1.6rem, 3vw, 3rem);
    padding: clamp(1rem, 2vw, 1.6rem);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 1rem;
    background: rgba(11, 11, 14, 0.55);
    backdrop-filter: blur(6px);
  }

  .hud-gauge {
    position: relative;
    width: clamp(6.5rem, 10vw, 9rem);
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .hud-gauge svg {
    width: 100%;
    transform: rotate(-90deg);
  }

  .gauge-track,
  .gauge-fill {
    fill: none;
    stroke-width: 6;
    stroke-linecap: round;
  }

  .gauge-track {
    stroke: rgba(242, 239, 232, 0.1);
  }

  .gauge-fill {
    stroke: var(--acid);
    stroke-dasharray: 326.7;
    stroke-dashoffset: 6.5; /* 98/100 */
    filter: drop-shadow(0 0 6px rgba(201, 242, 75, 0.45));
  }

  .gauge-num {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 2.4vw, 2.3rem);
    color: var(--acid);
  }

  .hud-side {
    flex: 1;
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.7rem;
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .hud-title {
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.22em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--ink-dim);
  }

  .hud-metrics {
    list-style: none;
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.55rem;
  }

  .hud-metrics li {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 3.2rem 1fr 3.4rem;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.8rem;
  }

  .m-name {
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    color: var(--ink-faint);
  }

  .m-bar {
    height: 4px;
    border-radius: 100px;
    background: rgba(242, 239, 232, 0.09);
    overflow: clip;
  }

  .m-bar i {
    display: block;
    height: 100%;
    width: calc(var(--v) * 100%);
    border-radius: inherit;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(201, 242, 75, 0.55), var(--acid));
    transform-origin: left center;
  }

  .m-val {
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--ink);
    text-align: right;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }

  .hud-note {
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    color: var(--ink-faint);
  }

  @media (max-width: 560px) {
    .perf-hud {
      position: relative;
      top: auto;
      left: auto;
      right: auto;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }
  }

  .cell-acid {
    grid-column: span 2;
    background: var(--acid);
    border-color: var(--acid);
    color: var(--acid-ink);
  }

  .cell-acid p {
    color: rgba(12, 14, 4, 0.72);
  }

  .cell-link {
    margin-top: auto;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    width: fit-content;
    border-bottom: 1.5px solid currentColor;
    padding-bottom: 0.15rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .bento {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .cell-big {
      grid-column: auto;
      grid-row: auto;
      min-height: 20rem;
    }

    .cell-acid {
      grid-column: auto;
    }
  }
</style>
